From: Claude <claude@anthropic.local>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 20:18:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/11] Phase 9: HistoryEntity + LikedEntity + DAOs, wired into
 DownloadDatabase (v2->v3)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- HistoryEntity: one table covering both SHORT_WATCH and DOWNLOAD rows,
  so Phase 11's timeline doesn't need to merge two tables.
- LikedEntity: keyed by the same videoId ShortItem/ShortsCacheEntity use,
  the durable counterpart to Phase 2's cache-local isLiked flag.
- HistoryDao/LikedDao under db/daos/, per spec.
- Extended DownloadDatabase (not ShortsDatabase, not a new database):
  history/likes are permanent user data, same durability class as
  DownloadRecord/ResolutionCacheEntity already there, unlike
  ShortsDatabase which is a deliberately evictable cache. Real Migration
  2->3 creating both tables.
- Data-layer only, no UI or write-side wiring yet — that's Phase 10.
